 solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;gap:40px" data-cols=""><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4">Can the final price change?</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.8">The final proposal may be adjusted according to scope, content and functionality. Anything outside the agreed scope is quoted before work begins — there are no hidden fees.</p></div><div style="padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;gap:40px" data-cols=""><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4">What about domains, licenses and subscriptions?</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.8">Domain registration, hosting, SSL configuration, and website maintenance are separate services and are not included in SEO Growth &amp; Maintenance plan prices. Licenses, subscriptions and premium third-party services are quoted separately. You own them.</p></div><div style="padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.09);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;gap:40px" data-cols=""><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4">Do you offer support after launch?</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.8">Yes. Monthly SEO growth and maintenance plans start at US$100/month and are optional.</p></div>
